# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# createBrowserRouter uses real URLs, so a hard refresh on /character/42 asks the host
# for a file that does not exist. Without this rule that request 404s and the app never
# boots — the one failure mode that no unit, integration or E2E test can see, because
# the dev server fakes the rewrite for you. Only the post-deploy smoke run catches it.
#
# Status 200, not 301: the URL must stay /character/42 for the router to read it.
# See docs/adr/0005-routing-strategy.md.
/*    /index.html    200
